      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a double-blind study of ketoprofen versus placebo in the treatment of osteoarthritis of the hip, it was shown by a sequential technique, that ketoprofen was significantly better than placebo. Some intolerance was observed but no more than with other non-steroidal antiinflammatory drugs. No changes were observed in biological parameters."},
